  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 NGA - Settlement Extents v3.0",
    "description": "The GRID3 NGA - Settlement Extents v3.0 consists of a geographic representation of settlements in the Nigeria, in two forms: 1) settlement polygons, and 2) spatial points depicting the centroids of settled grid cells at 3-arc seconds (or ~100 meters) contained within settlement polygons. Both layers include attributes as described in the codebooks. Data inputs and methodology to derive the 2 layers is described in this document. Keywords: settlement extents, settlement grid",
